Convert aws downloaded airnow data to ioda nc file for RRFS-SD PM2.5 DA with baseline removed
Huiying Luo, last updated Sept 2025 for v2

How to:
1. source modulefile
2. Set time for conversion in driver_do_airnowioda_blrm.ksh; Set proper pathes, switch data download on/off in convert-airnow-blrm.ksh
3. ./driver_do_airnowioda_blrm.ksh  

Once run successfully, 
airnow-2024072000-blrm-v2.nc will be generated in testout

Info:
PM2.5 baseline is estimated from 2015-2024 obs using method adapted from O'Doherty et al. (2001) and Hung et al. (2019). More details can be found here https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/19c17-n-x9OO5csZWAYegB-AUDks5utBX/edit?slide=id.p1&pli=1#slide=id.p1 
Full year baseline is shared here on github and Jet (/mnt/lfs6/BMC/wrfruc/hluo/PMDA_utilities/PM25_iodaconverter/IODA_hourlyPM25baseline_v2r1.nc)
Also in this folder, airnow_sites_epalist_20240716.csv is the AirNow site file. It is used for searching for nearby station when baseline estimates not avaialble for specific sites. 

In test folder:
airnow obs: HourlyData_2024072000.dat (can be downloaded by scripts in convert-airnow-blrm.ksh)
site info: monitoring_site_locations_20240720.dat (can be downloaded by scripts in convert-airnow-blrm.ksh)

